<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QBE says 15 pct return on Allstate buy.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QBE says 15 pct return on Allstate buy.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>QBE Insurance said on Tuesday that the Allstate Insurance group it purchased last month would have a return on equity invested of over 15 percent in the current 1996/97 year.</p>
<p>&quot;For Allstate in this fiscal year, we'll have a greater than 15 percent return on equity invested,&quot; managing director John Cloney told the annual general meeting.</p>
<p>QBE bought the U.K. reinsurance operations of Allstate Insurance Co for A$70 million in September and said it expected the acquisition to be closed by early November.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
